sequence Login
  person User
  person Web app
  person Server
  person Database
  == The user logs in
  User -> Web app: types the password
  Web app -> Server: POST /login
  Server -> Database: find the user
  Database --> Server: the stored hash
  alt the password is right
  Server -> Server: open a session
  Server --> Web app: 200 welcome
  Web app --> User: home page
  else the password is wrong
  Server --> Web app: 401 refused
  Web app --> User: try again
  end
  note the same for mobile
